## Error handling pattern

Every FB that can fail exposes on `VAR_OUTPUT`: `bError`, `hrErrorCode`, and optionally a domain enum `eError`.

Full declaration template: `skills/twincat3-new-library/templates.md`. Domain-specific error shapes: skills `twincat3-http`, `twincat3-mqtt`, `twincat3-modbus`.

